{"id":"empleado","lemma":"empleado","pos":"adj","rank":1921,"glosses":["employed"],"ipa":"/empleˈado/","forms":{"feminine":"empleada","masculinePlural":"empleados","femininePlural":"empleadas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/03/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-empleado.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tom es un empleado.","en":"Tom is an employee.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/799913"},{"text":"Ella es una empleada en el supermercado.","en":"She is a clerk in the supermarket."},{"text":"Nuestra compañía tiene 30 empleados.","en":"Our company has thirty employees.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/803518"},{"text":"Tom es nuestro empleado.","en":"Tom is our employee.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/799912"},{"text":"Ella no es una empleada habitual de esta compañía.","en":"She's not a regular employee of this company."}]}